  "summary": {
    "en": "In the past 8 hours the DSH plugin ecosystem added 70 plugins, reaching 17,672 total, while official repos gained 176 stars; dsh-market led growth at +33 stars and the official 0.2.1-alpha.1 release shipped. However, 16,449 tracked repos saw no update within a day and the health score sits at 40, indicating activity is concentrated in a small set of projects worth watching.",
    "zh": "过去 <b>8</b> 小时生态新增 <b>70</b> 个插件，总量达 <b>17672</b> 个，官方仓库星标涨了 <b>176</b>；dsh-market 以 <b>33</b> 星领跑增速榜，官方同步发布 0.2.1-alpha.1。不过 <b>16449</b> 个仓库一天内无更新、健康分仅 <b>40</b>，活跃度集中度偏高，建议持续观察。"
